      </defs>
    </svg>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <a class="brand" href="#tonight" aria-label="Afterglow home"><span class="brand-mark"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-sun"/></svg></span>afterglow<span class="brand-period">.</span></a>
      <div class="sidebar-kicker">GOOD NIGHTS START HERE</div>
      <nav class="side-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#tonight" data-nav="tonight" class="nav-item active"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-home"/></svg><span>Tonight</span><span class="nav-dot"></span></a>
        <a href="#discover" data-nav="discover" class="nav-item"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg><span>Discover spots</span></a>
        <a href="#crew" data-nav="crew" class="nav-item"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-users"/></svg><span>Your people</span></a>
        <a href="#rewards" data-nav="rewards" class="nav-item"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-award"/></svg><span>Good-night club</span></a>
        <a href="#profile" data-nav="profile" class="nav-item"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-user"/></svg><span>My profile</span></a>
        <a href="#account" data-nav="account" class="nav-item"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg><span>Account</span></a>
        <a href="#admin" data-nav="admin" class="nav-item" id="admin-nav" hidden><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-store"/></svg><span>Owner dashboard</span></a>
      </nav>
      <div class="sidebar-bottom">
        <div class="night-note"><div class="mini-spark">✦</div><p>A night to remember.<br/><em>A morning to enjoy.</em></p><button class="text-button" data-action="guide">A little night-out wisdom <span>↗</span></button></div>
        <button class="sidebar-ride" data-action="ride"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-car"/></svg><span>Plan your ride home</span><span>↗</span></button>
        <div class="sidebar-footer">21+ &nbsp;·&nbsp; YOUR NIGHT. YOUR PACE.</div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <header class="topbar">
        <a class="mobile-brand" href="#tonight"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-sun"/></svg>afterglow.</a>
        <div class="breadcrumb">YOUR LITTLE NIGHT-OUT COMPANION <span>✦</span></div>
        <div class="topbar-actions"><button class="location-button" data-action="area"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg><span id="header-area">Choose your area</span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></button><button class="account-button" data-action="account" id="account-button"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg><span>Sign in</span></button><button class="avatar" data-action="profile" aria-label="Open your profile" id="header-avatar">A</button></div>
      </header>
      <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
        <section id="view-tonight" class="view" aria-labelledby="tonight-title">
          <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow" id="today-label">A LITTLE PLANNING. A LOT OF GOOD MEMORIES.</p><h1 id="tonight-title">Make tonight a <em>good one.</em></h1><p class="subtitle" id="greeting">Your favorite people. A new favorite spot. A pace that’s yours.</p></div><button class="button button-light" data-action="share-night"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-share"/></svg>Share your plan</button></div>
          <div class="hero-grid">
            <article class="hero-banner">
              <img class="hero-photo" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514933651103-005eec06c04b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=85" alt="Warm pendant lights in an inviting restaurant bar" fetchpriority="high" />
              <div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-pill"><span class="tiny-dot"></span>THE NIGHT IS YOURS</div><h2>Good company.<br/><em>Great memories.</em></h2><p>Find your spot. Bring your people.<br/>Keep a little eye on your night.</p><a class="button button-peach" href="#discover">Find your next spot <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><span class="hero-stamp">STAY<br/><strong>GOLDEN</strong><span>✦</span></span>
            </article>
            <article class="session-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NIGHT, AT A GLANCE</span><span class="small-badge" id="session-status">Ready when you are</span></div><div class="session-middle"><div><span class="session-number" id="drink-count">0</span><p>alcoholic beverages logged</p><span class="muted tiny" id="session-since">A fresh start to your evening</span></div><div class="session-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>✦</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-glass"/></svg><i>✧</i></div></div><div class="session-bottom"><span><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg><strong id="session-time">Not started</strong></span><button class="text-button" data-action="session" id="session-button">Start your night <span>↗</span></button></div></article>
          </div>
          <div class="metrics">
            <article class="metric"><div class="metric-top"><span>Standard drinks</span><span class="metric-icon peach"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-glass"/></svg></span></div><div class="metric-number" id="standard-count">0.0 <small>drinks</small></div><div class="metric-foot"><span class="soft-dot"></span><span id="standard-caption">Based on size &amp; strength</span></div></article>
            <article class="metric"><div class="metric-top"><span>Your personal cap</span><button class="icon-button" data-action="limit" aria-label="Edit your personal cap"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-edit"/></svg></button></div><div class="metric-number" id="cap-count">— <small>set a cap</small></div><div class="cap-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Standard drinks relative to personal cap" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" id="cap-progress"><span id="cap-fill"></span></div><span class="tiny muted" id="cap-caption">A personal choice, not a safety threshold</span></article>
            <article class="metric"><div class="metric-top"><span>Water check</span><span class="metric-icon mint"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-drop"/></svg></span></div><div class="metric-number" id="water-count">0 <small>glasses</small></div><button class="text-button mint-text" data-action="water">Log a glass · 8 oz <span>+</span></button></article>
            <article class="metric"><div class="metric-top"><span>Estimated BAC</span><button class="icon-button" data-action="guide" aria-label="Read about BAC limitations"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-info"/></svg></button></div><div class="metric-number bac-number" id="bac-count">—</div><button class="text-button" data-action="bac-setup" id="bac-caption">Set up a quick estimate <span>↗</span></button><p class="tiny muted" id="bac-band"></p><p class="tiny muted bac-warning">Estimate only. Never use it to decide whether to drive.</p></article>
          </div>
          <div id="cap-notice" class="notice warning" role="status" hidden></div>
          <div class="content-grid"><div class="main-column">
            <article class="panel drink-panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">KEEP TRACK, STAY PRESENT</span><h2>What’s in your glass?</h2></div><button class="text-button" data-action="custom">Custom drink <span>+</span></button></div><p class="muted small">Tap a drink, then check its pour size and alcohol percentage.</p><div class="drink-grid">{drinkPresets.map((drink) => (<button class="drink-tile" data-drink={drink.id}><span class="drink-emoji" aria-hidden="true">{drink.emoji}</span><strong>{drink.name}</strong><span>{drink.abv === 0 ? "0% alcohol" : `${drink.oz} oz · ${drink.abv}%`}</span><i aria-hidden="true">+</i></button>))}</div><div class="panel-footer"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-info"/></svg>A strong or large pour can count as more than one standard drink.</div></article>
            <article class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE LITTLE DETAILS</span><h2>Your evening, in order</h2></div><button class="text-button" data-action="history">Past nights <span>↗</span></button></div><div id="timeline" class="timeline"></div><div id="drink-mix" class="drink-mix"></div></article>
          </div><div class="side-column">
            <article class="panel crew-teaser"><div class="card-top"><span class="eyebrow">BETTER TOGETHER</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-users"/></svg></div><div class="overlapping-circles" aria-hidden="true"><span>✦</span><span>☻</span><span>♡</span><span>+</span></div><h2>Your kind of people.</h2><p class="muted small">Trivia crew? Sunset catch-up?<br/>Make a plan worth showing up for.</p><a class="button button-outline full-width" href="#crew">Make a crew plan <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><p class="tiny muted">Invitations you choose to share. No public location broadcast.</p></article>
            <article class="hydration-card"><span class="water-illustration" aria-hidden="true">💧</span><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CHECK-IN</span><h3>Water belongs<br/>on the guest list.</h3><p>Take a pause and check in with yourself. Water doesn’t lower BAC.</p><button class="button button-mint" data-action="water">I had some water <span>+</span></button></article>
          </div></div>
          <div class="section-heading discovery-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHANGE OF SCENERY?</span><h2>Find your next favorite.</h2></div><a class="text-button" href="#discover">Explore spots <span>↗</span></a></div><p class="data-caption" id="home-places-caption">A little inspiration · illustrative venues and stock photos</p><div class="venue-grid" id="home-venues"></div>
          <div class="ride-banner"><span class="ride-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-car"/></svg></span><div><h3>The best last stop? Home.</h3><p>Line up a sober ride before the night gets going.</p></div><button class="button button-light" data-action="ride">Make a ride plan <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></div>
        </section>

        <section id="view-discover" class="view" aria-labelledby="discover-title" hidden>
          <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SAME PEOPLE. NEW FAVORITE PLACE.</p><h1 id="discover-title">Find your <em>kind of night.</em></h1><p class="subtitle">Cozy corners, sunset seats, and somewhere with your song on.</p></div><button class="button button-light" data-action="area"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Change area</button></div>
          <form class="search-form" id="bar-search"><label class="search-field"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-search"/></svg><input name="query" id="bar-query" placeholder="City, neighborhood, or bar name" maxlength="120" aria-label="Search area or bar name" required /></label><button class="button button-peach" type="submit">Find spots <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button><button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-action="locate"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Near me</button></form>
          <div class="filter-row" aria-label="Venue filters"><button class="filter-chip selected" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All vibes</button><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="restaurant" aria-pressed="false">🍽 Restaurants</button><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="cocktail" aria-pressed="false">🍸 Cocktail bars</button><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="rooftop" aria-pressed="false">☀ Rooftops</button><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="music" aria-pressed="false">♫ Live music</button><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="sports" aria-pressed="false">◎ Sports bars</button><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="saved" aria-pressed="false">♡ Saved</button><label class="rating-filter">Rating <select id="rating-filter" aria-label="Minimum venue rating"><option value="0">Any rating</option><option value="4" selected>4.0+</option><option value="4.5">4.5+</option></select></label></div>
          <div class="places-status"><p id="places-caption" class="data-caption"></p><a id="maps-search" class="text-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/bars/">Search Google Maps <span>↗</span></a></div><div id="venue-results" class="venue-grid expanded"></div><div id="google-attribution" class="google-attribution" hidden><img src="https://maps.gstatic.com/mapfiles/api-3/images/powered-by-google-on-white3.png" alt="Powered by Google" /></div><p class="tiny muted">Location is requested only when you tap “Near me.” Coordinates stay in memory and are sent to Google only for a live search. Check-ins share a chosen venue, not a live GPS feed.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="view-crew" class="view" aria-labelledby="crew-title" hidden>
          <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BRING THE GOOD COMPANY</p><h1 id="crew-title">Every night needs <em>its people.</em></h1><p class="subtitle">Start with a plan. Send it to someone you’d love to see.</p></div><button class="button button-peach" data-action="new-crew"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg>Create a plan</button></div>
          <div class="notice subtle"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-info"/></svg><span>Your plans are private to this browser. Invitations can be shared through your messaging apps. Public member discovery, live attendance, and chat aren’t connected.</span></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><h2>Your crew plans</h2><span class="small-badge">LOCAL PLANS</span></div><div id="crew-plans" class="crew-grid"></div>
          <div class="section-heading space-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">BORROW A LITTLE INSPIRATION</p><h2>What’s everyone’s vibe?</h2></div><span class="muted tiny">Plan templates · not live groups</span></div>
          <div class="template-grid"><article class="template-card terracotta"><span class="template-emoji">🎶</span><span class="eyebrow">FOR THE ONE-MORE-SONG PEOPLE</span><h3>The live music crew</h3><p>Find a local set, pick a meeting spot, and get there for the opener.</p><button class="text-button" data-template="Live music crew">Use this plan <span>↗</span></button></article><article class="template-card olive"><span class="template-emoji">🧠</span><span class="eyebrow">GOOD QUESTIONS. BETTER COMPANY.</span><h3>Trivia &amp; a catch-up</h3><p>Bring your most random facts. Zero-proof drinks welcome, always.</p><button class="text-button" data-template="Trivia & a catch-up">Use this plan <span>↗</span></button></article><article class="template-card mauve"><span class="template-emoji">🌅</span><span class="eyebrow">LOW-KEY IS A WHOLE VIBE</span><h3>The golden-hour club</h3><p>A patio, some snacks, and enough time to actually talk.</p><button class="text-button" data-template="The golden-hour club">Use this plan <span>↗</span></button></article></div>
          <div class="panel social-search"><div><h3>Looking to meet new people?</h3><p class="muted small">Explore public events on Meetup. Event listings and attendance are managed there.</p></div><a id="meetup-link" class="button button-outline" href="https://www.meetup.com/find/?keywords=social" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find public events ↗</a></div>
        </section>

        <section id="view-rewards" class="view" aria-labelledby="rewards-title" hidden>
          <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE GOOD-NIGHT CLUB</p><h1 id="rewards-title">Make the memories <em>count.</em></h1><p class="subtitle">A little recognition for looking after yourself and your people.</p></div><span class="rewards-spark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></div>
          <div class="reward-intro"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-award"/></svg><div><h2>Good choices look good on you.</h2><p>Awards celebrate planning, hydration, and getting home. Alcohol quantity never earns points.</p></div><strong id="badge-total">0 / 4</strong></div><div id="badge-grid" class="badge-grid"></div><div class="panel space-top"><h3>Your own pace is the whole point.</h3><p class="muted">There’s no drinking leaderboard here. Share a crew plan and agree to check in with each other. A zero-proof night belongs in the club, too.</p><button class="button button-outline" data-action="share-night">Share your plan <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-share"/></svg></button></div>
        </section>

        <section id="view-account" class="view" aria-labelledby="account-title" hidden>
          <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR AFTERGLOW ACCOUNT</p><h1 id="account-title">One sign-in. <em>Your night stays yours.</em></h1><p class="subtitle">Use an account for secure access and owner tools. Drink history, body measurements, and BAC details remain private to this browser.</p></div><button class="button button-peach" data-action="auth" id="account-primary-button"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg><span>Sign in or create account</span></button></div>
          <div class="notice warning" id="account-config-warning" hidden><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-info"/></svg><span>Account services are ready in the code but still need the two public Supabase environment values. The rest of Afterglow continues to work normally.</span></div>
          <div class="account-grid">
