abel><label id="weight-label">Weight · lb<input name="weight" type="number" min="66" max="661" step="0.1" placeholder="Optional" /></label><label id="height-label">Height · inches<input name="height" type="number" min="47" max="91" step="0.1" placeholder="Optional" /></label><label class="wide">Model reference<select name="model"><option value="off">Off — don’t show an estimate</option><option value="both">Show both adult reference calculations</option><option value="male">Male reference equation</option><option value="female">Female reference equation</option></select><span class="field-note">These are physiological reference equations, not gender labels. Neither measures your individual body composition.</span></label></div><label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" name="adult" required />I confirm that I am 21 or older.</label><div class="form-actions"><button class="button button-peach" type="submit">Save my profile <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></button><span id="profile-saved" class="tiny muted" role="status"></span></div></form><div class="side-column"><article class="panel profile-preview"><div class="profile-avatar" id="profile-avatar">A</div><h2 id="profile-display-name">Your good-night self</h2><p class="muted small" id="profile-display-area">Somewhere good</p><p id="profile-display-bio" class="small">Add a few things that make you, you.</p><div id="profile-tags" class="tags"></div><div class="profile-private"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg>Private to this browser</div></article><article class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CHECK-IN</span><h3 id="checkin-name">No venue selected</h3><p class="small muted">Share a venue with the people you choose. Personal body measurements and BAC are never included.</p><button class="button button-outline full-width" data-action="checkin">Set or share a check-in</button></article><article class="panel"><h3>Your data, your choice.</h3><p class="muted small">Browser storage is not an encrypted account. Use your own device and export a backup if you need one.</p><button class="text-button full-width" data-action="export">Export my data <span>↓</span></button><button class="text-button danger-text full-width" data-action="delete-data">Delete local data <span>×</span></button></article></div></div>
