    <dialog id="drink-dialog" aria-labelledby="drink-title"><div class="dialog-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">A QUICK NOTE, THEN BACK TO YOUR NIGHT</p><h2 id="drink-title">Log a drink</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-close aria-label="Close drink form"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-close"/></svg></button></div><form id="drink-form"><input type="hidden" name="editId"/><div class="form-grid"><label class="wide">Drink name<input name="name" maxlength="70" required /></label><label>Type<select name="type">{drinkPresets.map(d => <option value={d.id}>{d.emoji} {d.name}</option>)}<option value="custom">✨ Other</option></select></label><label>Quantity<input name="qty" type="number" min="1" max="10" step="1" value="1" required /></label><label>Size of each serving<input name="size" type="number" min="0.1" max="2000" step="0.1" value="12" required /></label><label>Volume unit<select name="unit"><option value="oz">US fluid ounces</option><option value="ml">Milliliters</option></select></label><label>Alcohol by volume · %<input name="abv" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" value="5" required /></label><label>When you started this drink<input name="at" type="datetime-local" required /></label></div><div class="drink-preview" id="drink-preview">Check the label or ask about the pour.</div><p class="tiny muted">Cocktail strength varies. Adjust the total drink volume and its finished ABV, not just the spirit’s ABV. You can log what you actually drank even after reaching your cap.</p><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-outline" data-close>Cancel</button><button class="button button-peach" type="submit">Save to my night <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></button></div></form></dialog>
